 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com),
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Changed
+
+- Added the default-enabled `standalone-indexing` feature for typenum's full
+  const-generic index bridge. Reduced nalgebra builds can omit this feature to
+  avoid compiling the bridge they do not use. Default builds retain their
+  existing behavior, and backend-free builds retain their existing indexing
+  API and supported index domain when `standalone-indexing` is enabled.
+- **Migration for backend-free builds:** with `default-features = false`, add
+  `standalone-indexing` to the feature list, alongside `std` or `alloc` if needed.
+  Bare no-default builds and builds enabling only `std` or `alloc` now report a
+  configuration error. Every build must enable `nalgebra` or
+  `standalone-indexing`; either bridge supports `no_std` without allocation.
 
 ## [0.1.1]
 
